{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(^‿^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りこぴと映画を観に行く約束をしたよ!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPC7MY9ZSJ2TCBGY9350VE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n誘ってくれてありがとう😊\n天気の子を見に行く予定です!とーーっても楽しみです。\n新海誠監督の映画作品が大大大好きなので、ずっと公開を楽しみにしてました✨\n出来るだけ早く行こうね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣三姉妹"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPC8N257D7N2SHN3S8P25F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n誰が一番お姉ちゃんに見えますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時の髪型はこんな感じ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPC9Z18MND2W7H5FRGZRKJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n上の方から編み込みの三つ編みをしてくるくるってしてピンで留めてます📍\nこれから夏祭りの季節なので是非、羊ヘアにしてみてね〜🐑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りぼんスペシャルバニラ が発売中です!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPCB4MAMZFP354Y4KHZWK2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n私もこれから読みます!\n夏の思い出のお供に、りぼんバニラを🍨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPCC4Z7SAE96HTWVYX2V2M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n🎀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}